{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>(!!!Epilepsy Warning, This Game contains scenes with flashing lights!!!)</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WELCOME TO ULTRA X-TREME HUNTING SIMULATOR 2001:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ULTRA X-TREME HUNTING SIMULATOR 2001</strong> will bring the classic arcade experience from 1995 to your bedroom with this fast paced, <strong>addictive</strong> arcade <strong>shooter</strong>! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hunt and Kill as many deer as you can!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492250/extras/Deer.png?t=1740757546\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore  Sequota National Forest!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492250/extras/map.png?t=1740757546\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>7 Level Locations! 42 Hunting Spots! 3 Extra Challenge Levels(coming soon)!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The all new control and aim mechanics will make this a must pick up and play <u>arcade shooter experience</u>. Travel around and take down wild game in the many levels and <strong>bonus challenges</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play alone and compete for the highest score! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The perfect game</strong> for\u00a0<strong>Hot Blooded Hunters</strong>, with <u>easy to pick up controls</u> that still pack a challenge for experienced players!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Northwood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492250/27e5125171dc68d2525cd3d23254abbe45145527.jpg"},{"name":"Lakeside Hills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3492250/0da25277160b